{"id":"77551da1497d10913809b8bae7b177df756851c6","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1230323","title":"claude 换 apple id 充值有风险吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"kqq19930511","excerpt":"Claude - @kqq19930511 - 之前一直用的尼日利亚 apple id 订阅的，已经发邮件下个月要涨价了，换个美区的 id 有影响吗？","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/Apple\"><li></li> Apple</a><a href=\"/tag/ID\"><li></li> ID</a><a href=\"/tag/风险\"><li></li> 风险</a></P><p><span>14 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-07-28 19:17:12 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17911044\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4e30/8bb0/338826_normal.png?m=1711937958\" alt=\"allanwell\" data-uid=\"338826\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/allanwell\">allanwell</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 10:31:01 +08:00\">22h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我干过，没遇到啥问题，先从美区 id 换尼区 id ，又换回了美区 id</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17911580\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b4cc54499e36cd02fb165cf5932a65c9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Berin\" data-uid=\"768010\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Berin\">Berin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 11:31:03 +08:00\">21h 5m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/allanwell\">allanwell</a> 请问你们还没被封的是用的老号吗？还是按照网上说的用家宽，改时区的方法保留下来的？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17912131\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b4cc54499e36cd02fb165cf5932a65c9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Berin\" data-uid=\"768010\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Berin\">Berin</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 13:53:51 +08:00\">18h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/kqq19930511\">kqq19930511</a> 那难怪了。早期注册的号大多是真实需求的普通用户。近一年的很多号不少应该是国内 AI 公司起的小号去蒸馏别人的数据库，所以对新号的审查很严格。哎，难受啊，普通人纯被牵连</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17912361\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4e30/8bb0/338826_normal.png?m=1711937958\" alt=\"allanwell\" data-uid=\"338826\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/allanwell\">allanwell</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-28 14:29:29 +08:00\">18h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Berin\">Berin</a> 非常老的老号，claude 刚出来没多久就开始用了。 时区 vps 什么的都没注意过。感觉老号的权重还是比较高的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17912486\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/b4cc54499e36cd02fb165cf5932a65c9?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Berin\" data-uid=\"768010\"></td>\n                <td><